WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:04.500
Episode 4

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:04.500
Astonishing World!!
The Yamato Exceeds the Speed of Light!!

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:04.500
( Air date: Oct 27, 1974 )

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.360
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.160
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.960
...it's the space battleship...

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:40.310
...Yamato.{Uchuu senkan yamato}

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:40.290
Space Battleship

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:40.290
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:48.170
It's about to take off to Iscandar,
carrying the fate of humanity.{Ucyuu no kanata Isckandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu}

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.560
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:55.060 --> 00:01:03.360
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:10.160
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:16.860
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:38.770
In October 2199...

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:44.260
...Earth's underground cities were being
contaminated by Gamilus' meteor bombs.

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:49.470
Mankind will be extinct
in approximately one year.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:55.170
The space battleship Yamato
just took off to head for Iscandar...

00:01:55.170 --> 00:02:00.620
...which is 148,000 light years
away in the large Magellanic Cloud.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:05.790
Will they be able to bring back the radioactive
contamination purifier in one year ?

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:16.970
Planet Gamilus

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:53.970
Vice President Hisu

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.880
My Lord, what do we
do about the Yamato ?

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:56.120
Lord Desler

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.030
Ignore it.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:03:01.040
But they say a cornered
mouse will attack a cat.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.600
Mouse, huh...?

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:07.930
Let our frontline base on
Pluto handle this mouse.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:32.760
Leaving Earth's gravity.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:35.420
Alright. Shift to
secondary space cruise.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:36.130
Aye, sir.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.980
Earth is getting smaller.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.770
It's so painful to look at.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:29.170
It looks even worse
than I expected.

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:32.100
Can we really save Earth ?

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.730
Of course, we have to.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:38.890
Did you forget the cries of
the people watching the parade ?

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.280
Everyone, we don't
have time for grief.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:47.970
We have so many
tasks to complete.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:51.220
Main staff, come to the
central planning room.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.390
We'll prepare for a super speed
test of the Wave Motion engine.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.310
Super speed test ?

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.270
It's about warp, Shima.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.530
Warp ?

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:09.980
The success of our journey depends on the
super speed test of the Wave Motion engine.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:16.580
{NIJUU}Even the speed of light isn't sufficient to
travel 296,000 light years in just one year.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:20.570
{SONO}Warp cruise will
shorten the travel time.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:25.610
{SORE}It's up to the Wave Motion engine, whether
it can generate enough power or not.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.870
Now, I'll explain warp.

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:36.490
Warp is a method to travel
faster than the speed of light.

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:38.090
{KORE}Please take a look at this.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:41.490
{EINSTEIN}This is a model of the
closed cosmology from Einstein.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:45.180
{KONO}This dot shows the
current location of the Yamato.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:50.070
{WARP}A warp is to jump
the time continuum.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:53.200
{TATOEBA}For example, assume
that time is a wave...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:06:01.230
{CHOTEN}...if we can jump from one apex to another,
we don't have to waste time in this valley.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:05.770
{TADA}However, real
warp isn't easy.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:10.310
{GENZAI}The dot shows
our current position.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:14.160
{KONO}The lines show the time
continuum of our destination.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.080
{KUUKAN}There's a slight gap due
to a dimensional distortion.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:20.790
{WARP}In order to successfully warp,
the gap has to be zero.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.970
{TSUMARI}In other words, we have to warp
when those two dots match.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:32.410
{MOSHI}If we miss the timing, we'll be trapped
between the third and fourth dimensions...

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.800
{YAMATO}...and not only the Yamato, but
the entire universe might explode.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:39.410
Shima, your responsibility as
chief navigator is very high.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.320
Oh.
Yes, sir.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:44.620
Ms. Mori, another condition
of warp is the location...

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:47.920
...which must be unaffected by
the gravity of other planets.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.200
Find a location
without any obstacles.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.300
Aye, sir.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:55.460
Alright.  As soon as the test site
is found, we'll conduct the test.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:03.170
Pluto Frontline Base

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.380
The Yamato is
cruising to Mars.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:03.710
Speed is 25 space knots.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:06.550
Gantz

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.750
What should we do,
Commander Shultz ?

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.130
Don't you know ?

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.180
We can't just
sit by and watch.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:17.580
We must destroy the Yamato for the
pride of the Pluto Frontline Base.

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:20.770
Prepare to launch
the high speed carrier.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:25.660
Shultz

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:27.280
I can't relax, despite
the kindness of Lord Desler.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:03.430
Between the Moon and Mars
seems ideal for a warp.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.430
Even if all the mechanisms function flawlessly...

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:12.390
...if I make a mistake, 
everything'll be messed up.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.030
Thank you.

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.790
Good luck.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:26.580
Hey Shima, if you're this tense now,
you won't be able to take it.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:27.530
Say what ?

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:35.530
All hands, the Yamato will carry out the warp
test as soon as it reaches the Moon's orbit.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:40.670
If we fail the test, it will destroy
not only us, but also all of mankind.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:44.080
Everyone, stay focused
and carry out your duties.

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:50.280
Dr. Sado, you can't
keep sleeping.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:00.910
What's the matter,
disturbing my sleep ?

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:03.460
The warp test
will be executed.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:07.480
What the...warp ?
Is that extra delicious soup ?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:10.870
It's about the Yamato
jumping across time.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:11.800
Is that so ?

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:13.250
Yes.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:12.310
Great
Sake

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:22.380
Tasty. Wake up
sake tastes great.

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:25.380
He's hopeless.
He didn't understand at all.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.990
Radar has picked up a strong return
from an unidentified flying object.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.170
Changing the video panel.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:10:00.230
It's a Gamilus carrier.  But it's still
too far away to directly attack us.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:03.060
All hands, combat
alert B status.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:08.320
Captain, request
permission to handle it.

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:12.720
But all energy is directed to the
Wave Motion engine for the test...

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.860
...so you can't use any
of the Yamato's weapons.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.670
Yes, sir.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.820
Nanbu, order the Black Tiger
team to take off immediately.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:21.820
Yes, sir.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:48.500
Black Tigers.  Launch.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.430
All Black Tigers launched.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.670
Alright, launch.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:32.300
Unidentified craft were
launched from the Yamato.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:40.270
Switching to the cosmo radar. Bearing
YZA to 27D. Speed, 600 space knots.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.200
How impudent. Launch
the high-speed boats.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:03.160
It'll enter the carrier's missile range soon.
Attack freely with torpedoes until then.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:25.550
Don't let even one Gamilus craft get by.
If we fail, the Yamato will be destroyed.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.210
The carrier is approaching.
Distance 80,000 km.

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:55.700
Retrieve the
fighter squadron.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:12.530
Gamilus high-speed carrier
is still approaching.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.490
The Yamato will be
in its range soon.

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:18.040
Thirty minutes
to the warp test.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.220
We'll warp before the
Gamilus carrier attacks.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:35.140
Kodai and Kato's
Cosmo Zero have landed.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.520
The Black Tiger
team is landing.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.150
The Yamato is
in Moon orbit.

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:43.230
Wave Motion engine is nominal.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.760
Data analysis ready.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:50.650
Twenty minutes to the warp test.
Warp automatic system, on.

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:52.120
Captain !

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:55.920
Please, wait.  Yamamoto, of the
Black Tigers, hasn't landed yet.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.630
But we can't abort.
Retrieve him quickly.

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:08.120
Kodai, this is Yamamoto
of the Black Tigers.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:11.260
Don't worry about me, and
proceed with the warp test.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.690
Idiot !  Come back,
no matter what !

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:22.480
Kodai, all the systems of the Yamato are
set to precise timing. We can't wait for him.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.320
But...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:26.940
The warp timing can't be changed.
Retrieve him quickly.

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.940
Fifteen minutes
to the warp test.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.010
It's no good !  I can't
maintain position.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.450
Nine minutes to
the warp test.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.590
Yamamoto, farther right !
Come right and dive in !

00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:00.100
No, too far !
To the left !

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:06.310
Alright, dive in.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:13.830
Yamamoto !

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:18.460
Kodai...

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:19.460
Yamamoto !

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.700
Yamamoto's plane just landed.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:28.300
Three minutes.
All hands, fasten seatbelts.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:38.250
I can't lose to Kodai.
The Yamato's destiny is in my hands.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.720
Shima, hang in there.

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.700
It's your game now.
My life's in your hands.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:47.470
Thirty seconds
till the warp test.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:57.340
The Yamato is targeted.
0.2 space seconds to our range.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.150
Twenty seconds.

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.500
Switch on.

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.500
The target of the Gamilus
missiles is the Yamato.  Launch.

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.060
Warp !

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:27.940
Warp.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.410
All missiles will hit.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:08.570
What happened
to the Yamato ?

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.330
Was it successful ?
Only one minute has passed.

00:19:58.220 --> 00:19:59.270
It's Mars.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.760
It was successful.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:13.760
We did it.

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:16.860
Shima !

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.270
Hey, Shima.

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:41.370
Congratulations.

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:42.900
Kodai...

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:50.620
Oh, no.
The ship was damaged.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.480
Shima, land on Mars.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:57.340
Aye, sir.

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:05.770
Lord Desler, we've received a message
from our Pluto frontline base.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:10.970
The Yamato warped
from the Moon to Mars ?

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.930
There must be
some mistake.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:18.280
Shultz of the Pluto frontline
base sent us everything.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:22.730
But they can't reach Iscandar unless
they can do something like that at least.

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:26.150
They're so amusing.

00:21:57.970 --> 00:21:59.470
It's snowing.

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:00.540
Snow.

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.620
We can't see it
on Earth anymore.

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.050
Mr. Sanada, repair the ship
as quickly as possible.

00:22:19.050 --> 00:22:20.330
Aye, sir.

00:22:20.330 --> 00:22:23.300
Shima, our destination
is point 3-6.

00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:26.060
Roger.
Destination, point 3-6.

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:16.220
If we reinforce this area,
Yamato's warp is hopeful.

00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:25.320
A short warp test, which would decide the
future of the 296,000 light year round trip...

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:28.320
...was successful,
despite minor damage.

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:35.100
However, the underground cities of Earth
are becoming contaminated even now.

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:37.310
Yamato, hurry up.

00:23:39.570 --> 00:23:44.970
362 days left

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:53.560
Okita Juzo:

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:53.560
Naya Goro

00:23:51.970 --> 00:24:00.570
A girl was waving her red scarf.{Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf}

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:59.570
Mori Yuki:

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:59.570
Asagami Yoko

00:24:00.570 --> 00:24:09.370
Who was that for ?{Dareno tame da to omotte iruka}

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:10.140
Notes:

00:24:09.370 --> 00:24:17.670
It doesn't matter who it was for...{Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka}

00:24:10.140 --> 00:24:20.140
Notes:
An ex-Mushi Production (of Osamu Tezuka), Yoshiyuki Tomino drew the storyboard.

00:24:17.670 --> 00:24:26.570
...everyone should take it as theirs.{Minna sono ki de ireba ii}

00:24:20.140 --> 00:24:26.140
Note:
Yamamoto of the Black Tiger team appeared.  He was popular among the fans, and he also appeared in Movie 2.  In TV Yamato 2, a first name of Akira was given.

00:24:20.140 --> 00:24:26.140
In the last scene, Captain Okita appeared
in black arrow on white uniform with an
open helmet.

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:34.970
In the hearts of men, who are
leaving on a long journey...{Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa}

00:24:26.670 --> 00:24:33.270
Translation

00:24:26.670 --> 00:24:33.270
Editing

00:24:33.270 --> 00:24:40.840
Timing

00:24:33.270 --> 00:24:40.840
Song Translations

00:24:34.970 --> 00:24:42.570
...a piece of romance is needed.{Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa}

00:24:40.840 --> 00:24:48.840
A

00:24:42.570 --> 00:24:46.570
La la la...

00:24:46.570 --> 00:24:50.570
La la la...

00:24:50.570 --> 00:25:00.470
La la la, red scarf.{makka na scarf}
